- Whether the 3×3 cm anterior triangle mass is intra-thyroidal, extrathyroidal, or separate from the thyroid gland;  
- Whether it is solid, cystic, or mixed;  
- Margin characteristics (well-defined vs irregular);  
- Vascularity pattern (peripheral vs central);  
- Anatomical relationship to the thyroid isthmus and lobes.

